+    +------+-------+---------+----------+--------+-------+--------------------+
+    | D.04 | 00100 |  110101 |  001010  |  D.20  | 10100 |       001011       |
+    +------+-------+---------+----------+--------+-------+--------------------+
+    | D.05 | 00101 |       101001       |  D.21  | 10101 |       101010       |
+    +------+-------+--------------------+--------+-------+--------------------+
+    | D.06 | 00110 |       011001       |  D.22  | 10110 |       011010       |
